[(breadcrumb)]

Frequently Asked Questions

**Q:** Rewrite engine doesn&#39;t work even though it is enabled on the server

**A:** Edit .htaccess file. Uncomment the line
&lt;code>#RewriteBase /pmc&lt;/code>
and change &#34;/pmc&#34; to reflect your instalation directory.
If you installed on the server root then the line would be
&lt;code>RewriteBase /&lt;/code>
